{'symbol': 'AMGN', 'date': '2021-09-14 16:00:00', 'title': 'AMGEN AND THE LUNDQUIST INSTITUTE ANNOUNCE THAT DIADEM THERAPEUCTICS WILL RECEIVE THE FIRST AMGEN GOLDEN TICKET TO BIOLABS LA', 'text': 'THOUSAND OAKS, CALIF., SEPT. 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMGEN\xa0(NASDAQ: AMGN) AND THE LUNDQUIST INSTITUTE TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT DIADEM BIOTHERAPEUTICS, INC., HAS BEEN AWARDED THE FIRST AMGEN GOLDEN TICKET IN SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA.'}